     | **Message Retention**        | Configurable, typically long-term (days, weeks, months). Data is durable on disk.[0m[2m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  | Configurable, typically shorter-term (hours, days). Data is in-memory by default (with optional disk persistence for recovery), which impacts cost and total retention volume. Retention must be actively[0m[2m managed to prevent memory exhaustion on the Redis instance.                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
